# {{ site.name }} — Full Content

> {{ site.name }} is a later-life moving, downsizing and relocation service based in Northampton, UK, founded in 2026. One dedicated coordinator manages every stage of a move: sorting and decluttering, packing, removals, estate agent and solicitor liaison, storage and settling-in support. Services are designed with older people and their families in mind and are open to anyone who wants a fully managed move.

