## Frequently asked questions

The full set of answers is at {{ site.url }}/elderly-removals-faq/. The most common:

**What is an elderly removals service?**
A service that helps older people move home from start to finish, not just transport belongings: sorting, packing, removal, sale-side coordination and settling in, with one coordinator.

**How much does it cost?**
The Discovery Consultation is £{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }}. Move packages start from £{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}, with full-service moves from £{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}.

**How early should I get in touch?**
Ideally 3 to 6 months before the intended move date, though shorter timescales can be accommodated where possible.

**Do I need to choose a package before contacting Chayce?**
No. The Discovery Consultation (in person or by phone) produces a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to a package.

**Will I have the same coordinator throughout?**
Yes. One coordinator stays with the client from first conversation to settling in.

**Is my move insured?**
Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit. Details are set out in the service agreement before the move begins.

